      "name": "Why it happens",
      "char_file": "계란_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Muscle drops about 3-5%",
        "per decade after 30, and up",
        "to 8% between 65 and 80",
        "",
        "Older muscle needs more",
        "protein in one sitting to respond"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Protein all at dinner",
      "char_file": "계란_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "US adults average 13g of",
        "protein at breakfast —",
        "and 38g at dinner",
        "",
        "So breakfast rarely clears",
        "the 25-30g threshold"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Close the breakfast gap",
      "char_file": "계란_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "A cup of cottage cheese or",
        "plain Greek yogurt is about 24g",
        "",
        "Spreading protein across",
        "three meals beats stacking",
        "it all at night"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Walking only",
      "char_file": "운동화_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Walking builds endurance,",
        "but sends muscle little",
        "reason to hold its size",
        "",
